docs {
  # HKI (Hak Kekayaan Intelektual) API
  
  CRUD endpoints untuk manajemen HKI milik user.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/hki`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | / | ✅ | All | List HKI user |
  | GET | /detail | ✅ | All | Detail HKI by ID |
  | POST | / | ✅ | All | Buat HKI baru |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | All | Update HKI |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | All | Hapus HKI |
  | POST | /:id/submit | ✅ | All | Submit untuk approval |
  
  ## Jenis HKI
  - Paten
  - Hak Cipta
  - Merek
  - Desain Industri
  
  ## Status HKI
  - Draft
  - Pending
  - Approved
  - Rejected
}
